# 统一换行符与二进制识别，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制产物：不做换行转换、不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary

# 文档类文本差异用 word-diff 更可读（仅提示，不影响行为）
*.md diff=markdown
